        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K650, Beaded Oval Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Brass Accents, the Revere Latchset is one of their more elegant designs. The oval plate measures 2-13/16 inches wide and 10-1/16 inches tall and has beading all the way around the edge. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from any of the available knobs or levers. The Revere Collection Latchset is available in a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D05-K650 Revere Collection Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob/lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. The finish for the knob or lever you choose will match the plate finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Revere Latchset, Brass Accents D05-K650",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K650, Revere Latchset - Made by Brass Accents, the Revere Latchset is one of their more elegant designs. The oval plate measures 2-13/16 inches wide and 10-1/16 inches tall and has beading all the way around the edge. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from any of the available knobs or levers. The Revere Collection Latchset is available in a wide array of finishes. \r\n",
                "keywords": "BRA-D05-K650, Brass Accents D05-K650, Revere Latchsets, Oval Revere Beaded Latchset, traditional knobs, classic knobs, traditional levers, classic levers, Beaded Oval Latchsets, Revere Collection Latchsets,"
